# counter/_websocket scope 200 — bump this session's counter.
#
# One key per session: `@websocket.session.id` is chassis-minted and
# unguessable, so it is a fine key prefix for per-connection state. The new
# value lands at `._kv`. These runs share the `counter` app's KV namespace
# (a `_`-nested inlet sub-stack defaults to its app stack's namespace), so
# a web request could read the same key.
WHEN .msg.type == "increment"
  EXEC "txco://kv/incr"
  WITH key = &concat("count:", @websocket.session.id)
